{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52360","headline":"诗 四 · 王梵志","name":"诗 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"王二语梵志：俗间无我师。\n心中不了义，闻者尽不知。\n我今得开悟，先身已受持。\n寻经醒无我，披《老》悟无爲。\n君身（项校「神」）自寂灭，君身若死屍。\n神身一分（任录作「六」）解，六识自开披。\n万事都无着，怜（项校作「泠」）然无所之。\n漏尽无烦恼，神澄自靡斯。\n心高鹄共驾，一举出天池。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52360.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52360","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}